 "summary": "The general alternating-map and sesquilinear-form descent API is public in the associated-bundle file, the top-exterior-power bijectivity is in the exterior-power file, and the spinor and determinant bundles come with frame-wise, unfolding and zero/symmetry/positivity lemmas carrying appropriate simp annotations. `@[expose]` is limited to the two type synonyms whose public statements need them to unfold, and only the implementation helper `refPoint` is private.",
